+            <name slugifiedName="name-orders-list">Orders List</name>
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-7.1.2.1-1">Each account object includes an &quot;orders&quot; URL from which a list of
+orders created by the account can be fetched via POST-as-GET request.
+The result of the request <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be a JSON object whose &quot;orders&quot; field
+is an array of URLs, each identifying an order belonging to the
+account.  The server <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14> include pending orders and <bcp14>SHOULD NOT</bcp14>
+include orders that are invalid in the array of URLs.  The server <bcp14>MAY</bcp14>
+return an incomplete list, along with a Link header field with a
+&quot;next&quot; link relation indicating where further entries can be
+acquired.</t>
